    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18163" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀφάσσω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		, 
			Ep.
		, and late Prose, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁφάω</span>
			, <i>feel,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
			</span></i>II, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφασον αὐτοῦ τὰ ὦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.69
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.710
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.428
			</span></i>, v.l. in
			<i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				317
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Musae.
				82
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥσπερ ἐν σκότει ἀφάσσων</span>”
				<i>groping,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Iamb.
				<u>Myst.</u>
				3.6
			</span></i>, etc.:—
				Med.
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.181
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Morb.</u>
				2.30
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				41
			</span></i>.</div>
